  "section_header": "BODY ELECTRICAL SYSTEM — Instruments and Sender Gauges",
  "title": "Speedometer",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Speedometer"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "ON-VEHICLE INSPECTION OF SPEEDOMETER"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Using a speedometer tester, inspect the speedometer for allowable indicating error and check operation of the odometer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "text": "NOTE: Tire wear and tire over or under inflation will increase indication error."
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(b) Check the speedometer for pointer vibration and abnormal noises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "text": "NOTE: Pointer vibration can be caused by a loose speedometer cable."
    },
