    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Tachometer"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "ON-VEHICLE INSPECTION OF TACHOMETER"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Connect a tune-up test tachometer and start the engine.",
        "(b) Compare the tester and tachometer indications."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If the error is excessive, replace the tachometer."
    },
    {
      "type": "caution",
      "text": "CAUTION:\n• Reversing the connection of the tachometer will damage the transistors and diodes inside.\n• When removing or installing the tachometer, be careful not to drop it or subject it to heavy shocks."
    },
